WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.965
"Let's have a Game Night!" said Aunt Judy.

2
00:00:19.966 --> 00:00:26.196
"Yes!" cried Emmy and Harry.

3
00:00:26.197 --> 00:00:32.838
First everybody played a board game.

4
00:00:32.839 --> 00:00:35.655
Emmy rolled the dice across the board.

5
00:00:35.656 --> 00:00:42.538
She moved her piece five spaces.

6
00:00:42.539 --> 00:00:45.464
Then Harry took a turn.

7
00:00:45.465 --> 00:00:52.342
"I get to move six spaces!" said Harry.

8
00:00:52.343 --> 00:01:01.840
Everyone took more turns.

9
00:01:01.841 --> 00:01:07.154
Soon Emmy's piece was in the lead.

10
00:01:07.155 --> 00:01:14.493
Emmy rolled the dice again.

11
00:01:14.494 --> 00:01:17.132
"Ugh," said Emmy.

12
00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:30.093
"I have to go back three spaces."

13
00:01:30.094 --> 00:01:35.728
Then Harry moved 12 spaces.

14
00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:40.363
His piece reached Home first.

15
00:01:40.364 --> 00:01:43.729
"I won!" said Harry.

16
00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:46.023
"I'm the best!"

17
00:01:46.024 --> 00:01:50.333
Emmy frowned.

18
00:01:50.334 --> 00:01:55.546
"Be a good sport, Harry," said Mom.

19
00:01:55.547 --> 00:01:59.072
Oliver frowned too.

20
00:01:59.073 --> 00:02:03.453
"I wanted to win!" Oliver whined.

21
00:02:03.454 --> 00:02:12.241
"Be a good sport, Oliver," said Mom.

22
00:02:12.242 --> 00:02:17.452
Next they played a guessing game.

23
00:02:17.453 --> 00:02:20.228
Aunt Judy stood up and clapped her hands.

24
00:02:20.229 --> 00:02:23.293
"Are you at a concert?" asked Harry.

25
00:02:23.294 --> 00:02:32.689
Aunt Judy shook her head but didn't say anything.

26
00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.782
"Are you a seal?" asked Emmy.

27
00:02:35.783 --> 00:02:39.240
Aunt Judy nodded silently.

28
00:02:39.241 --> 00:02:43.725
"Yay!" said Emmy. "I'm the best!"

29
00:02:43.726 --> 00:02:47.619
Harry sighed.

30
00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:53.808
"Be a good sport, Emmy," said Mom.

31
00:02:53.809 --> 00:02:58.499
Emmy stood up and flapped her arms.

32
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.707
"Are you a bird?" asked Mom.

33
00:03:01.708 --> 00:03:05.304
Emmy nodded.

34
00:03:05.305 --> 00:03:08.356
"I'm the best!" shouted Mom.

35
00:03:08.357 --> 00:03:10.485
Dad gave Mom a look.

36
00:03:10.486 --> 00:03:18.071
"Be a good sport, honey," he said.

